    <string name="screens_off_while_playing">Bottom screen while playing</string>
    <string name="screens_off_while_playing_help">What the bottom screen shows while a game plays on the top one: the game\'s art, Tandem\'s companion, Screen off (black and still until you tap it, the biggest battery saving on this screen) or nothing at all, for an emulator that draws there itself. 3DS and DS emulators keep their own screen whatever this says. Y on a system or a game chooses for that one alone.</string>
    <string name="screens_off_after">Off after</string>
    <string name="screens_off_after_help">Minutes without a touch on the bottom screen before it goes dark while a game plays, whatever it shows, until you tap it. Never keeps the dimmed art or companion up all game long. With Screen off, this is also how long a tap lights the screen.</string>
